\details{
Provides methods for subscribing, redeeming, and querying Simple Earn
flexible and locked products on Binance. Inherits from \link{BinanceBase}.
\subsection{Purpose and Scope}{
\itemize{
\item \strong{Product Discovery}: List available flexible and locked earn products.
\item \strong{Subscriptions}: Subscribe to flexible or locked products.
\item \strong{Redemptions}: Redeem from flexible or locked positions.
\item \strong{Positions}: Query current flexible and locked positions.
\item \strong{History}: Retrieve subscription and redemption history records.
}
}

\subsection{Usage}{

All methods require authentication (valid API key and secret).
These are wallet (\verb{/sapi/}) endpoints, not spot (\verb{/api/}) endpoints.
}

\subsection{Official Documentation}{

\href{https://developers.binance.com/docs/simple_earn/Introduction}{Binance Simple Earn}
}

